flowchart TB
    hub["Your instruction hub<br/>CI publishes plugins"]
    hosts["Your agent hosts<br/>Install and use plugins"]
    worker["Your trace analyzer<br/>Analyze sessions"]
    storage["Your storage<br/>PostgreSQL: state<br/>AWS S3: traces"]
    supervisor["Planned supervisor<br/>Your PIG resources:<br/>updates and migrations"]
    hosted["Hosted Promptless<br/>Enrollment, findings<br/>and remediation"]
